# Use an HTTP client extension or copy these bodies into curl.
# Each new demonstration needs a fresh playerId and external IDs/idempotency keys.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@playerId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101
@walletId = REPLACE_WITH_WALLET_ID

### Public readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Open with 100.00 BRL. Copy the returned id into walletId above.
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerId":"{{playerId}}","initialBalance":{"amount":"100.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### BET: expected balance 75.00 BRL.
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:demo-bet-001

{"providerId":"provider-a","externalTransactionId":"demo-bet-001","playerId":"{{playerId}}","walletId":"{{walletId}}","roundId":"demo-round-001","gameId":"demo-game","kind":"BET","money":{"amount":"25.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### WIN: expected balance 85.00 BRL. Then repeat BET above: replay returns 75.00.
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:demo-win-001

{"providerId":"provider-a","externalTransactionId":"demo-win-001","playerId":"{{playerId}}","walletId":"{{walletId}}","roundId":"demo-round-001","gameId":"demo-game","kind":"WIN","money":{"amount":"10.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### Current balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Exact reconciliation; expected consistent=true and difference.amount="0.00".
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation
